{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1190223-forsaken-february-heralds-of-the-firstborn","id":1190223,"title":"Forsaken February - Heralds of the Firstborn","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-28T05:52:47-08:00","id":1190223,"title":"Forsaken February - Heralds of the Firstborn","content":"So there I was, looking to the future, thinking to myself that once I did the Twelve Days - which would obviously, at the latest, be finished before the end of January, right? - I'd need to consider what to do for February. Obviously I could do nothing, but that would be a grave waste of a fantastic piece of alliteration for a thread title, namely Forsaken February. Letting that go to waste would be a crime.<br /> <br /> \u200bHere we are now and I haven't *technically* completely finished the Twelve Days just yet but close enough, right, and it's still *just* February, so therefore I still have a chance to make use of the Forsaken February title, and I'm damn well going to do exactly that. Of course, I originally had a notion for several threads throughout the month and we're kinda outta time for anything so lengthy, so I guess I'm going to have to leap straight to what was going to be the final vote and make it a big one.<br /> <br /> \u200bTime to vote! Would you like the write-up for a royal avatar of:<br /> \u200ba) Destroyer Wolf; or<br /> \u200bb) Death Wolf; or<br /> \u200bc) Black Wolf; or<br /> \u200bd) Red Wolf; or<br /> \u200be) Winter Wolf.<br /> <br /> \u200bDon't worry, the next thing I do for March will be a little more normal-scale and down to earth, after the relatively high end scope of this one and the First Day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like hel